  kernels (an elementwise op on 37 MB, a 660×384×1536 GEMM). Output: c_boundary(N, mode) on the
  5090 with spread. Prior calibration points to compare against: Hazy (H100: ~2.1 µs stream,
  ~1.3 µs graph); NVIDIA CUDA 12.6 straight-line graph (~0.55 µs/node on RTX 3060). Until measured,
  no per-boundary number is used anywhere.
0.5 Send the dossier + audit log to 2–3 systems researchers (Pekhimenko group and authors of the
