- **Wk 1 (Sep 16–22):** Phase 0 complete; emails sent; pod booked. Session 1.
- **Wk 2 (Sep 23–29):** Session 2 (sweep, microbenches, traces). Phase 2 ledger delivered.
- **Wk 3 (Sep 30–Oct 6):** owner audits ledger; picks X's; issues per-X handoffs.
