- **Dec:** applications with a completed study and a defensible preprint. ISPASS submission if
  and when its date and the contribution justify it.

## What the owner audits at each gate (so agent work stays trustworthy)
- Phase 1: SESSION_RESULT.md threshold section computed mechanically; three rows of the kernel
  table against output_code; planted-fault result; profiling-perturbation ratios; graph-deployment
  verification for C3/H; clock windows.
- Phase 2: recompute two ceilings by hand; check the stacking note; check every confidence-C row's
  assumption is stated.
- Phase 3: each intervention's realized/ceiling and its unprofiled matched timing.

